     8706               in frame Dialog-Frame.
     8707           end.
     8708           else do:
     8709             display
     8710               buf_doc-line.doc-qnty  @ FI_doc-line_doc-qnty
     8711               buf_doc-line.fact-qnty @ FI_doc-line_fact-qnty
     8712               buf_goods.unit-base    @ FI_unit-base
     8713               with frame Dialog-Frame.
     8714           end.
     8715           if buf_trn-doc.doc-type = 'инв':U
     8716           then do:
